{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/main.gif?t=1750591473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive isolation and earn $1,000,000.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features of the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival in a closed room. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every hour you get $1000. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can leave without money at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you collect 1 million dollars, you can take them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main thing is not to go crazy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maintain your mental health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Money can be used to purchase goods in the store, but prices are increased 100 times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0421reate items that will help you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful in the room besides you there is someone else. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/extras/spider.gif?t=1750591473\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806370?t=1750591473","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806370?t=1750591473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/297a179c17f166879a491237e5a8a19c828326d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750591473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806370/297a179c17f166879a491237e5a8a19c828326d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750591473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"F